# AGENTS.md

Context for AI coding agents working in this repository.

## Project

{{ project_name }} — a FastAPI REST API generated by [flint](https://github.com/abdulazeezoj/flint).

## Setup

```
uv sync
```

## Run

```
uv run fastapi dev src/{{ package_name }}/main.py
```
{% if migrations %}
Apply migrations first: `uv run alembic upgrade head`.
{% endif %}
{% if worker == "taskiq" %}
Run the worker (separate process): `uv run taskiq worker {{ package_name }}.worker:broker --app-dir src`.
{% elif worker == "celery" %}
Run the worker (separate process): `PYTHONPATH=src uv run celery -A {{ package_name }}.worker.celery_app worker --loglevel=info`.
{% endif %}

## Test

```
uv run pytest
```

## Layout

- `src/{{ package_name }}/main.py` — the FastAPI app (`app`) and its routes.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/core/config.py` — `Settings` (`pydantic-settings`),
  loaded from `.env`. Add new config fields there, not scattered
  `os.environ` reads.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/schemas.py` — Pydantic request/response models.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/routes/items.py` — the example `items` resource.
{% if database != "none" %}
- `src/{{ package_name }}/db/` — {{ orm }} models (`models.py`) and the
  async session/engine (`session.py`).
{% endif %}
{% if migrations %}
- `alembic/` — migrations. New model → `uv run alembic revision
  --autogenerate -m "..."`, review the generated file, then `uv run
  alembic upgrade head`.
{% endif %}
{% if worker != "none" %}
- `src/{{ package_name }}/worker.py` — the {{ worker }} app/broker.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/tasks.py` — background tasks; add new ones here.
{% endif %}
{% if redis %}
- `src/{{ package_name }}/core/redis.py` — the Redis client
  (`redis_client`), ready for caching.
{% endif %}
- `tests/` — pytest tests{% if database != "none" %} against an
  isolated in-memory SQLite database via a `get_session` override in
  `tests/conftest.py` — the production database is never touched by
  the test suite{% endif %}.

## Conventions

- Dependencies are managed with `uv` via `pyproject.toml` — don't hand-edit
  `uv.lock`; run `uv add <package>` / `uv remove <package>` instead.
- Keep route handlers typed; return plain dicts or Pydantic models, not
  raw strings.
{% if database != "none" %}
- New endpoints that touch the database take `session` via
  `Depends(get_session)` — don't create engines/sessions ad hoc.
{% endif %}
